52	/**
53	 * The one word this entry is allowed to be summarised by.
54	 *
55	 * `passed` would be a lie and `failed` would be one too. The build completed
56	 * and repeats; no journey has run. The outcome names both halves so that no
57	 * downstream renderer has to choose which half to carry.
58	 */
