667	- Target cell: \`${receipt.cell.id}\` — Angular ${receipt.cell.angularLine}, \`${receipt.cell.builder}\`, Node ${receipt.cell.node}
668	- Adapter at ingestion: frozen composite \`${receipt.frozenAdapter.compositeFingerprintAtIngestion}\`, ${receipt.frozenAdapter.bytesChangedAtIngestion} bytes changed; ${receipt.frozenAdapter.applicationFilesHandEdited} application files hand-edited
669	- Authorized reopen: ${reopen.statement}
670	- Derived from committed run evidence: ${receipt.runEvidence.map((item) => `\`${item.path}\` (\`${item.sha256}\`)`).join(', ')}
671	
