40	/**
41	 * The composite fingerprint over the five frozen subtrees, at the boundary this
42	 * re-run measured against. The receipt embeds the subtree oids and recomputes
43	 * the composite from them in its own parser, so the freeze claim is checked
44	 * against itself rather than believed.
45	 */
