245	 * parity + pass-twice determinism verdict is recomputed from the measured passes
246	 * by `summarizeWitnessReactCypressRwaTwoLaneParity` — the same gate the driver
247	 * used — so a doctored journey fails here rather than publishing a green it did
248	 * not earn. The frozen composite is recomputed from the receipt's own subtree
249	 * oids, so an edited fingerprint or oid is caught too.
