523		return `# cypress-realworld-app — holdout PASS receipt (re-run under the frozen adapter)
524	
525	- Outcome: **${receipt.holdoutOutcome}** — the frozen adapter carries this application at this revision, end to end
526	- Kind: ${receipt.kind}
527	- Canonical SHA-256: ${receipt.integrity.canonicalDigest}
