530	- Source: ${receipt.source.repository} at \`${receipt.source.ref}\` (\`${receipt.source.revision}\`, ${receipt.source.license}), create-react-app ${receipt.source.reactScripts} over webpack ${receipt.source.webpack}, React ${receipt.source.react}, TypeScript ${receipt.source.typescript}
