534	## The migrated build under the frozen adapter
535	
536	${receipt.frozenAdapter.composition} — **${receipt.migratedBuild.result}**, ${receipt.migratedBuild.bundler}, ${receipt.migratedBuild.attempts} attempts, deterministic: ${receipt.migratedBuild.deterministic}. ${receipt.migratedBuild.modulesTransformed} modules transformed (transform ${receipt.migratedBuild.transformPhase}, emit ${receipt.migratedBuild.emit}), ${receipt.migratedBuild.outputFiles} output files, output digest \`${receipt.migratedBuild.outputDigest}\`.
537	
538	## The measured journey — two lanes, twice each, live loopback backend
539	
540	- Behaviour digest (shared across both lanes and both passes): \`${receipt.journey.behaviorDigest}\` — two-lane behaviour parity: ${receipt.journey.behaviorParity}, over genuinely distinct builds: ${receipt.journey.lanesAreDistinctBuilds}
541	- Baseline lane: ${baseline.legs.ok}/${baseline.legs.total} legs, semantic digest \`${baseline.semanticDigest}\` (deterministic across ${receipt.journey.passesPerLane} passes), ${baseline.laneStaticFiles} SPA files, bundle digest \`${baseline.laneStaticDigest}\`
542	- Migrated lane: ${migrated.legs.ok}/${migrated.legs.total} legs, semantic digest \`${migrated.semanticDigest}\` (deterministic across ${receipt.journey.passesPerLane} passes), ${migrated.laneStaticFiles} SPA files, bundle digest \`${migrated.laneStaticDigest}\`
543	- Recorded navigations: ${receipt.journey.navigations.map((route) => `\`${route}\``).join(' → ')}
544	- Locality: successful non-loopback requests: ${receipt.journey.successfulNonLoopback}; mocked non-loopback (in-context avatar SVGs): ${receipt.journey.mockedNonLoopback}; live-backend category endpoints: ${receipt.journey.backendCategorySize}
545	
546	## Determinism and locality
547	
548	- Re-seeded from the frozen snapshot before every pass: ${receipt.determinism.reseededFromSnapshotBeforeEachPass}; minted values placeholdered: ${receipt.determinism.mintedValuesPlaceholdered}; pass-twice semantic digest stable: ${receipt.determinism.passTwiceSemanticDigestStable}
549	- Locality mode: ${receipt.locality.mode}; successful non-loopback: ${receipt.locality.successfulNonLoopback}; OS-wide isolation: ${receipt.locality.osWideIsolation}
550	
551	## Counting and non-claims
552	
553	Legs per lane: ${receipt.counting.legsPerLane}; lanes measured: ${receipt.counting.lanesMeasured}; passes per lane: ${receipt.counting.passesPerLane}; counted in lineage numerator: ${receipt.counting.countedInLineageNumerator}. ${receipt.counting.countingNote}
554	
555	${receipt.nonclaims.map((claim) => `- ${claim}`).join('\n')}
556	`;
557	}
558	
559	export async function verifyHoldoutReactCypressRwaWitnessEvidence(rootDir = '.'): Promise<{
560		valid: true;
561		digest: string;
562		artifacts: number;
563		receipt: HoldoutReactCypressRwaWitnessReceipt;
564	}> {
565		const root = resolve(rootDir);
566		const published = parseHoldoutReactCypressRwaWitnessReceipt(
567			JSON.parse(
568				await readFile(join(root, HOLDOUT_REACT_CYPRESS_RWA_WITNESS_RECEIPT_PATH), 'utf8'),
569			),
570		);
571		const derived = await deriveHoldoutReactCypressRwaWitnessReceipt(root);
572		if (canonicalize(published) !== canonicalize(derived))
573			throw new Error(
574				'Cypress RWA witness holdout receipt does not match its committed run evidence',
575			);
576		if (
577			(await readFile(join(root, HOLDOUT_REACT_CYPRESS_RWA_WITNESS_MARKDOWN_PATH), 'utf8')) !==
578			renderHoldoutReactCypressRwaWitnessReceipt(published)
579		)
580			throw new Error('Cypress RWA witness holdout human receipt differs');
581		return {
582			valid: true as const,
583			digest: published.integrity.canonicalDigest,
584			artifacts: published.runEvidence.length,
585			receipt: published,
586		};
587	}
