13	
14	/**
15	 * The eShop WebSPA holdout Witness specification.
16	 *
17	 * The journey is the anonymous catalog surface and nothing else, because that is
18	 * the whole surface the application genuinely offers a visitor who has not
19	 * signed in. Every gesture is issued against the application's own class names,
20	 * and every anchor is a settled reaction — a rendered item count, the pager's
21	 * own interpolated line, the option the keyboard selected — never a wait.
22	 *
23	 * The API surface behind it is the declared same-origin projection, and it is
24	 * the SAME projection factory for both lanes, so the two normalized behavior
25	 * digests are comparable.
26	 */
